{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Bloody Jar item targeting, confirmation, conversion and persistence",
  "contract": "The server sends an item-targeted Bloodforge spell without client file edits. Selecting supported gear sends one non-gossip action with the exact irreversible-conversion warning, which the existing Ascension UI auto-selects to open Accept/Cancel directly. Conversion and the three-second cast require acceptance for that exact item instance. Abandoned, expired, replaced or interrupted requests leave gear unchanged. Normal Bloodforged conversion preserves GUID, affixes and enchants through relog; the jar is reusable.",
